  "scope_warning": "These are paired honest errors of smaller pre-physics013/014 anchors, not cross-fitted complete013/014 residual errors. Final014-minus013 outer loss changes are the primary evaluation; changes in the pre-physics bases are a stage diagnostic. Training-size and model-stage mismatch are explicit. Pooling320 anchor errors is safe for this fixed outer risk procedure, not permission to cross-validate models on pooled residual labels.",
  "primary": "Mean(delta014-minus013 | selected condition) minus mean(delta | other), pooled over3x400 pairs with only400 unique IDs; report actual013/014 RMSE and signed residual changes in each group. A positive contrast need not mean harm: both groups may improve. It is a prospective association audit, not improvement in prediction RMSE, causal evidence, or independent research validation.",
