  "validation": "Independent sort/interpolate quantiles and loop rule scoring; all15 rules refit after poisoning outer labels and outer feature values; assert decisions unchanged. Reload both anchors and assert yB-anchor014 equals saved residual; independently reconstruct base013 affine too; check group disjointness/A-B-V scopes and reconstruct014 outer sum. Independent raw8 image metrics on400 development images, morphology4 on6 label-blind hash-selected images. Synthetic fixed rule fixtures.",
